stdout:
stderr:
Usage of baseline:
  -json
    	print JSON output
  -last string
    	bounded evidence lookback (default "30m")
  -loki string
    	Loki base URL for log evidence (default "http://localhost:3100")
  -prometheus string
    	Prometheus base URL (default "http://localhost:9090")
  -service string
    	target service.name for scoped evidence
  -tempo string
    	Tempo base URL for trace evidence (default "http://localhost:3200")
